"test":{"name":"ai-role-worth","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"roleWorth","question":"What each unit does for its side (AIWorld.RoleWorth, forecastRoleWorth): the damage it can do to each enemy unit, in that unit's worth, weighted by how little else on its side can hurt it, per point of its own worth, against its side's average, kept within roleWorthMin..roleWorthMax. Blue's only anti-air (the missile truck) against Red's gunship and bomber is worth more than its price, more than a grunt; the supply unit counts at its price (1); every multiplier is within 0.5..2. The forecast prices the truck by it (AIWorld.Value).","rules":"standard"},
